Endless Night ritual by the clan of death. I'm still trying to brainstorm the system towards the metaphysics of such thing actually happening. Any ideas?<br /> <br /> - Saga</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That sounds interesting! Can you elaborate more on the story? How was the ritual accomplished and by whom?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T12:11:19-08:00","id":1500062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saga</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1499940-endless-night-revised-v20#post1499940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm STing the Time of Judgment (Sixth Age in particular but only taking some elements from that book) and I'm going with a successful scenario for the Endless Night ritual by the clan of death. I'm still trying to brainstorm the system towards the metaphysics of such thing actually happening. Any ideas?<br /> <br /> - Saga</div> </div> </div> </div>It depends on the story but here some miscellaneous ideas to give you something to brainstorm.<br /> <br /> -Gradual or abrupt absence of the Gauntlet/The Shroud. Everything from the Labyrinth now merging with the material universe to nothing truly dying to Spirits from High Umbra and Middle Umbra being free to do whatever they want.<br /> -Mass introduction of Wraits and Spirits to the living world, possibly collapsing the living civilization as we know it and temporarily paralyzing the entire Hierarchy of the Underworld as you basically have to rewrite all the laws about the living world.<br /> -A cruel cycle of Shadowlands merging with the living world causing people and things to die and be destroyed which in turn births more Wraiths<br /> -Collapse of the Technocratic paradigm and with it, the modern world as we know it. The mundane Technology is back to being a paradox magnet and the Technocracy is in full emergency mode.<br /> -Rise of the Tal'Mahe'Ra, they are one of few factions fully adapted to this new world. They already had their main base in Enoch and have extensive experience with Wraiths, Shadowlands and the living world. Not to mention being a combination of Elder Vampires, Mages, Wraiths and Abominations.<br /> -Clan Giovanni either rise to power or collapsed, depending on how they accomplished it and whatever they actually were ready for the consequences of their actions.<br /> -Mummies are working full time to contain the damages, on one hand they got Duat at the living world and thus basically even more powerful. In fact they can be truly unkillable since the best way to &quot;kill&quot; them in the living world was to reduce their body beyond repair and cause them to be stuck in the Shadowlands but now even that is gone. But on the other hand, seeing all the death and destruction this will bring, they would prefer not to have it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27335-technoma","name":"Technoma","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-19T12:49:33-08:00","id":1500122,"title":"","content":"I don't think the Giovanni thought through their big plan very well, or at least not the ones who believed bringing down the Shroud would make them masters of the world. After all, they already had Dominate in addition to Necromancy, and that didn't allow them to conquer the world of the living. Merging the two planes of existence just lets ghosts interact with them (and other people) in direct ways, which is a two-sided blade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}